In the coprime case \((r,dp)=1,\)  \cite{cited} shows that: this is
a smooth family over \({\mathbb {A}}_t^1\) ; the fiber of \(\tau \)  over \(t= 0 \in {\mathbb {A}}_t^1\)  recovers (REF );
the fiber over \(t= 1\)  recovers (REF ), post-composed with the natural morphism between the Hitchin bases \(A(C^{(1)}_p) \xrightarrow{} A(C_p)\) ; this latter is identified with the relative Frobenius of \(A(C_p)\) .
